S['body-close']['instruction']='Refit both air scoops with their projections in aircase holes, grooves over ribs and remaining projections in slots; fasteners7Nm. Restore right-cover projections and slots, keeping its rib below the rear-fender rib. Refit aircase cover with rear slots over case edges and side ribs aligned with scoop projections; secure quick fastener and restore breather. Slide seat forward and tighten its two bolts22Nm; restore left cover and ordinary cover fasteners7Nm. Refit fuel-cap cover with plastic bands fully under seat. Confirm connectors, wire clearance, fuel connections, drain/filter/filler and verified oil-check-bolt closure before restart.'
